<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 40 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 88, borderBottom: '3px solid #1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>五种方法，验证同一个问题</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 6 }}>当分数看起来稳定时，证据支持是否也稳定？</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 190, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 17, paddingTop: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 233, height: 180, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, gap: 6 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 10, color: '#8B97A8' }}>01</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>基线对比</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 9, color: '#8B97A8' }}>（Baseline）</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1A2230' }}>不建模可靠性会怎样</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 233, height: 180, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, gap: 6 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 10, color: '#8B97A8' }}>02</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>组件消融</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 9, color: '#8B97A8' }}>（Ablation）</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1A2230' }}>支持量是否真被组件改变</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 233, height: 180, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, gap: 6 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 10, color: '#8B97A8' }}>03</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>参数敏感性</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 9, color: '#8B97A8' }}>（Sensitivity）</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1A2230' }}>结论是否只是碰巧</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 233, height: 180, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, gap: 6 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 10, color: '#8B97A8' }}>04</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>失败案例</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 9, color: '#8B97A8' }}>（Failure Case）</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1A2230' }}>高 Raw 是否仍被接受</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 233, height: 180, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, gap: 6 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 10, color: '#8B97A8' }}>05</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>外部结构迁移</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 9, color: '#8B97A8' }}>（External Transfer）</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1A2230' }}>结构能否跨域运行</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 310, background: '#F0F5FC', borderLeft: '5px solid #1E4FA8', padding: 20, gap: 10 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>参数敏感性证据卡（Sensitivity）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>693 = 21 × 11 × 3　660 defined　33 undefined</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1A2230' }}>扰动幅度：±10% / ±20%</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>0 decision-state flips（决策状态零翻转）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>五条路径不是五个新主张，而是同一个可审查问题的五种压力测试。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: '#4A5568' }}>每条路径统一报告：为什么问 → 怎么设 → 结果 → 支持什么 → 不支持什么</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.5, color: '#8B97A8' }}>不新增实验解释，只收束既有冻结证据</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 10, color: '#0E3F8C' }}>06 / 10</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
